Tether Agent is inspired by Hermes Agent from Nous Research:
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent

Tether Agent is a new program in Go, but some parts are ports of Hermes Agent
code from Python to Go. Some prompts, rules, patterns, and test cases are
copied from Hermes Agent. These parts include:

- The secret redaction rules (internal/security/redact.go, from agent/redact.py).
- The dangerous-command rules and the approval flow (internal/security/,
  from tools/approval.py).
- The threat rules of the skill guard (internal/skills/guard_patterns.go and
  internal/skills/testdata/guard_golden.json, from tools/skills_guard.py).
- The threat rules of the memory guard (internal/tools/memory_threat.go, from
  tools/threat_patterns.py).
- The prompts for child agents, background reviews, context compaction, and the
  summary at the tool-round limit (internal/agent/, internal/ctxmgr/).
- The rule that stops automatic compaction after two compactions in a row that
  leave the request over the threshold (internal/ctxmgr/compactor.go, from
  agent/context_compressor.py).
- The Telegram message format, stream, group gate, incoming media notes, sticker
  cache, and media delivery rules (internal/telegram/, from gateway/).
- The fuzzy match of the patch tool (internal/tools/patch.go).
- The tool preview keys (internal/tools/preview.go, from agent/display.py).
- The skill install flow, the trust policy, the TRUSTED_REPOS list, the lockfile
shape, and the install disclaimer text (internal/skills/, from
tools/skills_hub.py, tools/skills_guard.py, and hermes_cli/skills_hub.py).
- The /goal loop, the goal judge and draft prompts, the continuation prompts, the
  contract parser, the gates, and the wait barriers (internal/goals/,
  internal/gateway/, from hermes_cli/goals.py and hermes_cli/goal_command.py).
- The todo_list tool, its compaction snapshot, its history restore, and its
  tool note (internal/tools/todo*.go, internal/agent/prompt.go, from
  tools/todo_tool.py, run_agent.py (the history restore, _hydrate_todo_store),
  and agent/coding_context.py).
- The skill slash commands: the command slug, the skill message text, the
  template tokens, and the rules for skills in the Telegram bot menu
  (internal/skills/command.go, internal/tools/skills.go, internal/gateway/,
  internal/telegram/poll.go, from agent/skill_commands.py,
  agent/skill_preprocessing.py, and hermes_cli/commands_platforms.py).
- Test cases from the Hermes Agent test suite.

